# A learner's actual Obsidian vault is external to this repository and must
# never be committed here — this project ships code that operates on a vault
# path the learner configures, not vault content. If a sample/fixture vault
# is added under tests/ for integration testing, it should be clearly marked
# as fixture data, not treated as an exception to this rule.
